    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "c98c55aaddb1a3f553fa": "Hail, adventurer. I am Rin'wosho, trader of Zuldazar. I come from the South Seas and bring many exotic goods and items from my homeland.$B$BPerhaps if you prove your worth to my tribe, I shall barter.  If you have any of my tribe's Honor Tokens, then perhaps we shall barter even more."
      },
      "name": "Rin'wosho the Trader",
      "subName": "Zandalar Supplies and Repair",
